//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu1, peano, torch
// REQUIRES: makefile_examples
//
// The four preloaded LUTs of group2 hold 32768 + 32768 + 32768 + 20064 int16
// entries, about 231 kB, and exceed the local memory of one AIE tile:
// basic-sequential allocation reports about 21 kB free. The compile fails.
// group2 needs a redesign that splits the LUTs across tiles or streams them
// over DMA.
// XFAIL: *
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_placed_group2
// RUN: cd test_placed_group2
// RUN: cp -r %S/data .
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: %run_on_npu1% make -f %S/Makefile targetname=group2 run_py
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: %run_on_npu1% make -f %S/Makefile targetname=group2 trace_py
